1
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:19,740
Wh-What is all this?

2
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,720
Poke, poke.

3
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,910
Oh, no! It's a trap!

4
00:01:02,910 --> 00:01:04,370
Wait, what is?!

5
00:01:16,090 --> 00:01:19,600
That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime

6
00:01:16,090 --> 00:01:19,600
Slime Diaries

7
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:40,050
Day 9: The Arrival of Winter

8
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:40,510
<i>One month after the harvest 
season of autumn...</i>

9
00:02:41,370 --> 00:02:43,820
<i>The seasons changed in the blink of an eye,</i>

10
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:47,670
<i>and Tempest was preparing 
to greet the winter.</i>

11
00:02:50,210 --> 00:02:53,670
<i>The wind really turned cold 
fast in these past few days.</i>

12
00:02:53,670 --> 00:02:55,270
Yes, it is winter now.

13
00:02:55,270 --> 00:02:57,420
Everyone, make sure you dress warm.

14
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:59,700
Even with resistances, 
you don't want to get careless.

15
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:03,780
By the way, I had this made!

16
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:06,900
A padded kimono? It looks nice and warm.

17
00:03:07,930 --> 00:03:11,330
I can't let everyone see me 
looking like I'm about to freeze.

18
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:15,040
But aren't you naked when 
you're in your slime form?

19
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,180
Huh?

20
00:03:20,470 --> 00:03:21,440
Oh...

21
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,690
...dear.

22
00:03:29,530 --> 00:03:31,300
Oh, Great Rimuru!

23
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:33,630
<i>Naked...</i>

24
00:03:34,550 --> 00:03:37,790
<i>You know, she's right! 
I'm buck naked right now!</i>

25
00:03:38,570 --> 00:03:41,740
<i>I'm just strutting around 
in my birthday suit!</i>

26
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:43,070
Great Rimuru!

27
00:03:43,070 --> 00:03:45,620
Greetings, Great Rimuru.

28
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:47,530
Hello, Great Rimuru!

29
00:03:47,530 --> 00:03:48,260
Hi!

30
00:03:47,950 --> 00:03:50,650
<i>Oh, no! What is this feeling?</i>

31
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:49,110
It's Great Rimuru!

32
00:03:49,110 --> 00:03:50,650
Hello!

33
00:03:50,650 --> 00:03:52,190
<i>My cheeks feel warm...</i>

34
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,800
<i>Hiya...</i>

35
00:03:58,150 --> 00:04:00,260
<i>Wait! This isn't the time to be shy!</i>

36
00:04:00,550 --> 00:04:02,920
<i>I was assembling everyone 
at the guard station!</i>

37
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:14,190
Guard

38
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:14,190
So, as you all know, 
most of this town is made of wood.

39
00:04:14,190 --> 00:04:17,900
Fire Awareness

40
00:04:14,570 --> 00:04:17,900
And it'll soon be getting colder and colder.

41
00:04:18,810 --> 00:04:21,070
People will be making fires for warmth,

42
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:24,400
which increases the risk of house fires.

43
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:28,580
So you'll need to both patrol 
and talk to people more every day.

44
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:31,550
We'll call it the Fire Awareness Campaign.

45
00:04:32,370 --> 00:04:36,500
For
Great
Rimuru
Only

46
00:04:32,870 --> 00:04:36,500
The campaign mascot, who specializes 
in the subject, is this guy!

47
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:43,760
Winter Fire Awareness

48
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:47,890
Fire Awareness

49
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:47,890
Let's Burn

50
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:47,890
Protect the Town by Being Prepared

51
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:47,890
Tempest Fire Prevention Campaign Mascot
Benimaru

52
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:50,600
Be careful of fire!

53
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:55,190
Be careful of fire!

54
00:04:57,050 --> 00:05:00,860
Um... I don't... think I like this.

55
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:02,450
Huh? Why?

56
00:05:06,740 --> 00:05:12,950
Let's Burn

57
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,840
I look like an arsonist.

58
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,950
Be careful of fire!

59
00:05:14,690 --> 00:05:17,180
Be careful of fire!

60
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,840
Healing Potion Research Lab

61
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,760
Heya!

62
00:05:29,370 --> 00:05:31,680
Ah, it's you, Great Rimuru.

63
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:35,230
It's not as bad as outside, 
but it's pretty cold in here, too.

64
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:40,200
Yes. I'm studying its effects 
on the growth of hipokute herbs.

65
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:48,240
How's it going for you, Gabiru?

66
00:05:53,810 --> 00:05:56,870
Yes... Vesta.

67
00:05:58,350 --> 00:06:00,960
It's growing just fine.

68
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,410
Good, good.

69
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:08,340
<i>Wait, when it's winter, do you Dragonewts...</i>

70
00:06:09,390 --> 00:06:11,080
What are you saying?!

71
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:14,430
No matter what the season is, I am fully 
alert and aware when carrying... out...

72
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:16,460
my duties...

73
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:23,420
at... all... times...

74
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:27,690
Well, the peace and quiet 
do make it easier to work.

75
00:06:30,910 --> 00:06:34,070
Uh... your face looks creepy.

76
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:39,790
Oh, Great Rimuru!

77
00:06:43,250 --> 00:06:47,300
*Dragonewt hibernation habits vary among individuals.

78
00:06:48,550 --> 00:06:58,310
That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime

79
00:06:48,550 --> 00:06:58,310
Slime Diaries

80
00:06:51,180 --> 00:06:53,200
You're asleep, aren't you?

81
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:57,730
Slime! ... Diaries...

82
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:03,310
Treant Forest

83
00:07:06,670 --> 00:07:08,540
I'm Apito.

84
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:16,640
I'm Zegion.

85
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:20,040
Today is another day of gathering nectar.

86
00:07:20,530 --> 00:07:21,460
Indeed.

87
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:28,390
There aren't many flowers in winter.

88
00:07:28,390 --> 00:07:29,240
Indeed.

89
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,750
We need to work hard.

90
00:07:39,830 --> 00:07:41,530
We got a lot, huh?

91
00:07:41,530 --> 00:07:42,480
Indeed.

92
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:50,610
For Delivery

93
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,330
That'll do it.

94
00:07:48,330 --> 00:07:50,610
Now, we must deliver it to Great Rimuru.

95
00:07:51,430 --> 00:07:54,210
Tempest, the paradise for monsters...

96
00:07:54,210 --> 00:07:55,080
Indeed.

97
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:57,110
Manual labor is a great thing.

98
00:07:57,110 --> 00:07:58,720
Peace is a great thing.

99
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:00,580
Bug! Bug!

100
00:08:04,970 --> 00:08:06,290
There's one!

101
00:08:06,290 --> 00:08:08,130
Bug! Bug!

102
00:08:12,110 --> 00:08:14,170
Hey, that honey...

103
00:08:14,170 --> 00:08:17,550
I just want a little taste of that honey.

104
00:08:17,550 --> 00:08:19,520
Honey...

105
00:08:20,670 --> 00:08:23,800
Just a little lick... One little lick...

106
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:25,790
Lady Milim!

107
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:29,320
Please stop bullying the weak.

108
00:08:32,930 --> 00:08:37,030
Come, now. You'll make Great Rimuru 
sad if only you get to taste it.

109
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:38,660
Aw...

110
00:08:42,670 --> 00:08:44,750
Very well.

111
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:51,490
That was scary...

112
00:08:51,490 --> 00:08:52,540
Indeed...

113
00:08:52,540 --> 00:08:54,320
We must get stronger.

114
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:02,350
Shuna, I'm going out to train.

115
00:09:51,810 --> 00:09:54,710
Wow, it feels so soft.

116
00:09:54,710 --> 00:09:55,990
I can have this?

117
00:09:55,990 --> 00:09:57,370
Of course.

118
00:09:57,370 --> 00:09:59,920
I'm so happy you like it.

119
00:10:15,590 --> 00:10:18,630
For Brother

120
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:27,500
You're supposed to wear 
those when you sleep.

121
00:10:28,650 --> 00:10:31,930
What does it matter? They're warm.

122
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:34,020
Your horns are warm?

123
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:36,590
My horns are <i>also</i> warm.

124
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,500
<i>I will be brief.</i>

125
00:10:56,050 --> 00:10:59,260
<i>We are currently roaming the Forest of Jura.</i>

126
00:11:00,690 --> 00:11:02,930
<i>Our goal is the city of monsters.</i>

127
00:11:14,540 --> 00:11:15,660
<i>Yes...</i>

128
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:17,740
<i>The town...</i>

129
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:20,400
<i>...where Shizu died.</i>

130
00:11:22,130 --> 00:11:25,410
You can't be sad forever, okay?

131
00:11:25,850 --> 00:11:29,160
<i>And also the town that had 
the delicious grilled meat!</i>

132
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:30,270
Huh?

133
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:36,380
<i>Oh, I remember that meat!</i>

134
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:38,290
<i>It was so nice.</i>

135
00:11:38,290 --> 00:11:40,720
<i>I hope we get there soon.</i>

136
00:11:44,850 --> 00:11:47,220
<i>I'm so hungry...</i>

137
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:49,470
What?!

138
00:11:49,470 --> 00:11:51,860
Stop dawdling, you three!

139
00:11:51,860 --> 00:11:54,020
Right...

140
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:58,700
Remember me sometimes, okay?

141
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:01,240
That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime

142
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:01,240
Slime Diaries

143
00:11:58,700 --> 00:12:00,360
Slime Diaries.

144
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:11,050
It's not fair that One Horn 
gets Rimuru all the time!

145
00:12:11,050 --> 00:12:12,020
It's Shion.

146
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:12,790
Yeah, that!

147
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:17,000
Me, too! Me, too! Let me hold him, too!

148
00:12:19,110 --> 00:12:21,870
To carry Great Rimuru means

149
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:27,060
to take up his noble ideals, as well 
as the destiny of this entire nation.

150
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:28,390
It does?

151
00:12:29,890 --> 00:12:32,700
Those feelings and their gravity

152
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:36,410
are so great that even Princess Shuna 
cannot be entrusted with them.

153
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:39,620
Just give him to me already!

154
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:48,410
That's wrong! Hold Great Rimuru up higher!

155
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:52,040
Walk at a relaxed pace, 
and keep your strides even!

156
00:12:54,170 --> 00:12:56,250
Your back is bent!

157
00:12:56,250 --> 00:12:58,240
What's the matter, Demon Lord?

158
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:01,810
You'll never be a great secretary that way!

159
00:13:01,810 --> 00:13:05,130
Shion, why only at times like these?

160
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:10,140
It's hard to walk like this!

161
00:13:22,260 --> 00:13:24,240
Revived!

162
00:13:22,610 --> 00:13:24,990
Revived

163
00:13:25,490 --> 00:13:27,540
Hey, uh, is there less of me?

164
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:29,200
You're imagining it!

165
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:35,000
<i>Slime Diaries</i>: to be continued!

166
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:35,000
That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime

167
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:35,000
Slime Diaries

168
00:13:36,150 --> 00:13:39,880
Guildmaster, I'm so hungry!

169
00:13:42,650 --> 00:13:43,630
What's that?!

170
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:53,060
I-It's a Knight Spider!

171
00:13:53,060 --> 00:13:54,220
Run!

172
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:01,230
You poked at its nest again, didn't you?!

173
00:14:01,230 --> 00:14:02,900
Kaval, you idiot! Dorkaval!

174
00:14:02,900 --> 00:14:04,650
Don't call me Dorkaval!

175
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:21,410
I'm Youm. Who are you people?

176
00:14:21,410 --> 00:14:22,130
Huh?

177
00:14:22,130 --> 00:14:24,220
Uh... I'm Fuze. Are you...

178
00:14:24,220 --> 00:14:26,340
Kaval! I like grilled meat!

179
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:30,040
I'm Rommel. I have a weak stomach, 
so I can't eat grilled meat.

180
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:33,100
I'm Eren! I want something warm 
to eat! It's cold out!

181
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:35,450
Hey! That's not what 
we should be talkingâ€”

182
00:14:35,450 --> 00:14:38,080
I'm Gido! I like hotpot 
and that kind of thing!

183
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:38,810
Hey!

184
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:43,270
Then we'll have hotpot for dinner!

185
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:44,400
Yay!

186
00:14:44,400 --> 00:14:45,650
Who is that?!

187
00:14:45,650 --> 00:14:48,650


188
00:14:48,650 --> 00:14:51,630
Hey! Listen to me, people!

189
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:56,550
<i>We arrived in Tempest without incident.</i>

190
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:05,700
Ah, there you are! Kurobe, Kurobe!

191
00:15:06,090 --> 00:15:09,090
Lady Milim! You came by to watch again?

192
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:12,010
Also, my name's Kurobei.

193
00:15:12,010 --> 00:15:13,850
Yeah, that!

194
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,510
They get along so well.

195
00:15:17,150 --> 00:15:19,410
What are you making today?

196
00:15:19,410 --> 00:15:23,100
Today, I'm making a sword for Gobta.

197
00:15:27,670 --> 00:15:32,630
When forging magisteel, you can't 
let your guard down for a second!

198
00:15:37,910 --> 00:15:42,390
Just... the slightest... 
change in... your strike...

199
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:45,510
can produce either... a great sword...

200
00:15:45,510 --> 00:15:47,220
or scrap metal!

201
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:49,420
It sure can!

202
00:15:50,300 --> 00:15:51,560
Eh?!

203
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,260
Incredible!

204
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:59,520
A short sword that can 
take down a Knight Spider!

205
00:16:00,010 --> 00:16:04,060
Hmm... I guess all's well that ends well.

206
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:07,480
Got a cold?

207
00:16:10,890 --> 00:16:13,660
So anyway, we have a visitor!

208
00:16:16,940 --> 00:16:21,090
<i>The humans have finally endeavored 
to make contact with Great Rimuru.</i>

209
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:24,250
<i>As a caretaker of the forest,</i>

210
00:16:24,250 --> 00:16:27,880
<i>I must carefully discern 
what it is they truly want.</i>

211
00:16:31,690 --> 00:16:33,590
It has a kick to it. I like it.

212
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,800
And they have such an invigorating aroma.

213
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:37,360
I can't stop eating them.

214
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:39,850
Hey! You guys are taking too much!

215
00:16:40,190 --> 00:16:42,440
<i>Wh-What?</i>

216
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:45,480
<i>My new winter potato chip 
flavor is that popular?!</i>

217
00:16:46,190 --> 00:16:48,360
New Winter Flavor

218
00:16:46,190 --> 00:16:48,360
-Yuzu and Pepper Flavor-

219
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:52,040
<i>Clearly, those three are very good people.</i>

220
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:56,290
<i>There can be no one bad among 
those who love nature's blessings!</i>

221
00:16:57,860 --> 00:17:00,900
Then I shall have one, as well.

222
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:07,660
I'm sorry, but they said 
they'd like seconds.

223
00:17:07,660 --> 00:17:09,240
I'll fry up more.

224
00:17:15,990 --> 00:17:17,140
Great Rimuru.

225
00:17:18,450 --> 00:17:21,310
Regarding your cooperation 
with the humans...

226
00:17:21,830 --> 00:17:25,810
Please think it over very carefully.

227
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:27,620
O-Okay...

228
00:17:28,370 --> 00:17:30,560
<i>She never sounds that serious.</i>

229
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:33,400
<i>Does this issue really run that deep?</i>

230
00:17:34,710 --> 00:17:38,410
Our addictive new item has 
a refreshing aroma and a touch of heat.

231
00:17:38,410 --> 00:17:41,340
No one beats Snack Bar
Jura for potato chips!

232
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:42,830
A wonderful place where you can laugh without a care

233
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:42,830
Snack Bar
Jura

234
00:17:57,610 --> 00:18:00,680
How would you like to be a champion?

235
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,970
What?

236
00:18:02,970 --> 00:18:08,220
I want everyone to think you and your 
buddies defeated the Orc Lord.

237
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,310
Huh?

238
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:14,330
And we'll spread rumors that the nation 
of monsters will work together

239
00:18:14,330 --> 00:18:16,490
with you brave youths 
and give you our backing.

240
00:18:17,650 --> 00:18:21,620
Then you'll go from being 
wanted men to being champions,

241
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:27,220
and we'll get everyone to believe 
we're friendly toward humans.

242
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:28,000
Hmm...

243
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,410
I get it!

244
00:18:32,130 --> 00:18:34,940
Well, just think about it, okay?

245
00:18:37,390 --> 00:18:40,300
<i>I thought he was just a joker, but...</i>

246
00:18:43,330 --> 00:18:46,600
We cannot allow a guest to go hungry.

247
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:51,650
<i>As if the boss wasn't weird enough, 
so are his subordinates.</i>

248
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:58,650
<i>They're all constantly going on about 
"Great Rimuru, Great Rimuru"...</i>

249
00:18:58,650 --> 00:19:02,990
Piping Hot

250
00:18:58,650 --> 00:19:02,990
Great Rimuru Buns

251
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:00,930
Welcome!

252
00:19:00,930 --> 00:19:02,990
They're piping hot!

253
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:09,010
You're Great Rimuru's guest, right? Here!

254
00:19:09,010 --> 00:19:09,880
Huh?

255
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,410
Uh, sure...

256
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:14,720
Take this Great Rimuru mask!

257
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:17,460
O-Okay, uh... thanks...

258
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:17,460
Have some savory Great Rimuru crackers!

259
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:19,490
You must try our Great Rimuru soup!

260
00:19:18,250 --> 00:19:19,970
Er, sorry...

261
00:19:19,490 --> 00:19:22,470
Hey, you're not forgetting our 
tri-colored Great Rimurus, are you?

262
00:19:22,470 --> 00:19:24,820
Have some grilled Great Rimuru!

263
00:19:22,470 --> 00:19:25,970
Great
Rimuru

264
00:19:22,470 --> 00:19:25,970
Great
Rimuru
Crackers

265
00:19:22,470 --> 00:19:25,970
Tri-colored
Great
